	"data": "Housing Inquiry Emails — Dual MEXT Married Couple Scenario\n\nDraft emails to each university's international office asking about married couple housing eligibility when both spouses hold MEXT scholarships (Student visas, not Dependent visas).\n\nKey question: Can two MEXT scholars who are married to each other use married couple housing?\n\nNAIST — CISS (Center for International Students and Scholars)\n\nTo: kokusai@ad.naist.jp (general) or ciss@ad.naist.jp\nCC: ryugaku@ad.naist.jp (International…",
